while you're building systems And another thing which we might touch upon later is the while writing the first book which is again 10 years ago one question was asked

29
00:03:32,550 --> 00:03:42,309
to us like what's the unit of work of an architect and we came to the conclusion at that time we called it the architectural decision now this is

30
00:03:42,309 --> 00:03:50,149
before ADR's architectural decision records and other topics came about but that really is architecture is about the running software in production

